				},
				{
					"id": 225001002,
					"content": "薄荷精油怎麼做…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						225001003
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 225001003,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}已經全忘了？哼，明明之前才一起做過，居然忘得這麼快…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						225001004
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鶯兒"
				},
				{
					"id": 225001004,
					"content": "#我再教{F#妳}{M#你}一次好了，先去採三株薄荷，再把薄荷拿到合成台上製成精油。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						225001005
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鶯兒"
				},
				{
					"id": 225001005,
					"content": "把精油拿回來給我，其餘的就交給我吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "鶯兒"
				},
				{
					"id": 225001006,
					"content": "薄荷精油有什麼用…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						225001007
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 225001007,
					"content": "嗯…主要是中和一些刺激性的成分…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						225001008
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鶯兒"
				},
				{
					"id": 225001008,
					"content": "不過，最重要的還是，薄荷的味道很適合璐璐這孩子。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						225001009
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鶯兒"
				},
				{
					"id": 225001009,
					"content": "女孩子的香味可不應該僅僅是一種聞起來的味道而已…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						225001010
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鶯兒"
				},
				{
					"id": 225001010,
					"content": "璐璐動人的活力，涉世未深的清純，我會將它們都融進這一盒香膏中，呵呵。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "鶯兒"
				}
